invariant: INV-14
file: quic_config.c
catches: quic_loop_test
reason: quic_config_ok stops asking hspost_ticket_age_ok, so ch_quic_init
  builds a ClientHello around a ticket older than its lifetime, which
  ch_connect over TCP refuses. The QUIC loop's check at the lifetime
  boundary requires the first stale millisecond to be refused.

--- old
    if (!hspost_ticket_age_ok(cfg)) {
--- new
    if (0) {
